y"],["ARC or PLC in Menard County","/arc-plc/texas/menard-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. In 2025, February to March landed at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids, and June to July ran 248%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 193% of normal. Grid 13023 had its driest year in 1954, at 39%.</p>"}
